</td></tr></table> (<i>𓆀</i>) when it lacks a crest.</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Triliteral phonogram or phonetic determinative for <i>wšm</i>, as in <i>wšm</i> (“ear of corn”).</li><li>Triliteral phonogram, replacing <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
