</td></tr></table> (<i>𓁦</i>).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Triliteral phonogram for <i>šꜣt</i>, as in <i>šꜣt</i> (“talon&#59; land of Shat”).</li><li>Logogram for <i>pḏ</i> (“span”) in the units of measurement <i>pḏ ꜥꜣ</i> and <i>pḏ nḏs</i>. &lsqb;New Kingdom&rsqb;</li><li>Determinative in <i>jꜣft</i> (“talon”). &lsqb;Pyramid Texts&rsqb;</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>(<i>in hieratic texts</i>) Logogram for <i>zꜣ</i> (“son”) by conflation with <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
