<td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;"><img src="./18ce177e.gif" style="margin: 2px;border: 0; vertical-align: middle; width:auto;" title="zA" alt="glyph" height="95"/></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table> (<i>𓅭</i>) &lsqb;19th Dynasty&rsqb;</li><li>Determinative in <i>swḥt</i> (“egg”).</li><li>Determinative in names of goddesses.</li><li>Determinative in <i>pꜥt</i> (“patricians”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Triliteral phonogram for <i>ꜥšꜣ</i>, as in <i>ꜥšꜣ</i> (“to be numerous”).</li><li>Logogram for <i>ꜥšꜣ</i> (“lizard”).</li><li>Determinative in words for lizards, as in <i>ḥntꜣsw</i> (“lizard”), <i>ꜥšꜣ</i> (“lizard”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Logogram for <i>štw</i> (“freshwater turtle”).</li><li>Determinative in <i>štw</i> (“freshwater turtle”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Biliteral phonogram for <i>jt</i> in <i>jty</i> (“sovereign”).</li><li>Logogram for or determinative in <i>mzḥ</i> (“crocodile”).</li><li>Logogram for or determinative in <i>ḫntj</i> (an epithet of the god Set as a crocodile).</li><li>Determinative in words relating to crocodiles and their perceived qualities&#58; <i>ḥntj</i> (“to be greedy”), <i>skn</i> (“greedy”), <i>ꜥẖm</i> (name of a demon, literally “Horrifier”), <i>ꜣd</i> (“to be angry or aggressive”), etc.</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Logogram for <i>sbk</i> (“Sobek”).</li><li>Determinative in <i>sbk</i> (“Sobek”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Logogram for <i>sꜣq</i> (“to gather or contract together”).</li><li>Determinative in <i>sꜣq</i> (“to gather or contract together”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>alternative form of <i>𓆋</i> (<table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
<table class="mw-hiero-table" style="border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr>
