</td></tr></table> (<i>𓈗</i>).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Logogram for <i>mw</i> (“water”).</li><li>Biliteral phonogram for <i>mw</i>.</li><li>Uniliteral phonogram for <i>m</i> in group-writing.</li><li>Determinative for water, liquid, and activities related to water.</li><li>Used in <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
