</td></tr></table>, a composite determinative for bodies of water. &lsqb;since the 18th Dynasty&rsqb;</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Biliteral phonogram for <i>mr</i>.</li><li>Biliteral phonogram for <i>mj</i>, as in <i>mjzt</i> (“liver”), <i>mjꜥḥꜥt</i> (“tomb”). &lsqb;since the 18th Dynasty&rsqb;</li><li>Logogram for <i>mr</i> (“canal”).</li><li>Determinative for bodies of water, interchanging with <i>𓈙</i> (<table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
