</td></tr></table>, a composite determinative for bodies of water. &lsqb;since the 18th Dynasty&rsqb;</li><li>Determinative for irrigated land. &lsqb;8th–11th Dynasty&rsqb;</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Uniliteral phonogram for <i>š</i>.</li><li>Occasional biliteral phonogram for <i>zn</i> in <i>zn</i> (“to open”), by confusion with <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr"><tr><td><table class="mw-hiero-table"><tr><td height="13"></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>, a variant of <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
<table class="mw-hiero-table" style="border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr>
