</td></tr></table> (<i>𓏒</i>).</li><li>Logogram for <i>š</i> (“pool, lake”).</li><li>Determinative for bodies of water, interchanging with <table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
<table class="mw-hiero-table" style="border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr>
