</td></tr></table>)</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Biliteral phonogram for <b>nw</b>.</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Variant of the sign 𓍇 (<table class="mw-hiero-table mw-hiero-outer" dir="ltr" style=" border: 0; border-spacing: 0; font-size:1em;"><tr><td style="padding: 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size:1em;">
