</td></tr></table> constitutes a uniliteral phonogram for <i>s</i>.</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Triliteral phonogram for <i>ꜥpr</i>, as in <i>ꜥpr</i> (“to equip”).</li></ol></html><h3>Egyptian</h3><p><b>Symbol</b></p><ol><li>Biliteral phonogram for <b>qd</b>.</li></ol></html>